0..72 Comment "/// `absurdArm` answers an empty case on a lambda\'s binder whose type an"
73..110 Comment "/// enclosing case refined to `Void`."
111..114 Comment "///"
115..188 Comment "/// Under the arm `Zero`, the binder\'s type `isVoid(Zero)` is a call that"
189..237 Comment "/// returns `Void`, so the empty case covers it."
238..317 Comment "/// The kernel admits the declaration as the checker does, and the fixture runs"
318..336 Comment "/// the other arm."
337..340 Comment "///"
341..418 Comment "/// The checker unfolds the binder\'s type to `Void` before it reads the case."
419..499 Comment "/// The kernel reads the decode of the returned call by its own evaluator before"
500..535 Comment "/// it reads the scrutinee\'s shape."
536..539 Comment "///"
540..556 Comment "/// - see: #2830"
557..590 Comment "/// - see: `refined-binder.gandr`"
